  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Bond order&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>number</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bonding</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>number</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>antibonding</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Electronic configuration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp;are:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>*</mo></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>*</mo></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvar